{"data": [{"author_id": "83466368", "created_at": "2026-11-03T09:02:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117542803001512138"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Listen to Financing the AI boom – In Conversation with Imène Rahmouni-Rousseau from Euro Matters – the European Central Bank Podcast wherever you get your podcasts!", "display_url": "pod.link/ecbpodcast/epi…", "end": 258, "expanded_url": "https://pod.link/ecbpodcast/episode/dGFnOnNvdW5kY2xvdWQsMjAxMDp0cmFja3MvMjQzMDg5MDg3NA", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117542811557851138/yuU6Xhln?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117542811557851138/yuU6Xhln?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 235, "status": 200, "title": "Financing the AI boom – In Conversation with Imène Rahmouni-Rousseau", "unwound_url": "https://pod.link/ecbpodcast/episode/dGFnOnNvdW5kY2xvdWQsMjAxMDp0cmFja3MvMjQzMDg5MDg3NA", "url": "https://t.co/eN9V43KZQb"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/jf4emudebG", "end": 282, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ecb/status/2117542803001512138/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117540844123136000", "start": 259, "url": "https://t.co/jf4emudebG"}]}, "id": "2117542803001512138", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 8033, "like_count": 31, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 14}, "text": "Big tech needs money to fund its activities.\n\nIn our latest podcast episode, Paul Gordon and Imène Rahmouni-Rousseau explore why some big tech firms are turning to Europe’s bond market, and what this could mean for Europeans.\n\nTune in https://t.co/eN9V43KZQb https://t.co/jf4emudebG", "url": "https://x.com/ecb/status/2117542803001512138"}, {"author_id": "83466368", "created_at": "2026-11-03T08:49:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117539650411827379"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "European banking supervisors contribute to keeping the banking system safe and sound. European banking supervision comprises the ECB and national supervisors of the participating countries.", "display_url": "bankingsupervision.europa.eu/press/speeches…", "end": 273, "expanded_url": "https://www.bankingsupervision.europa.eu/press/speeches/date/2026/html/ssm.sp261103~dff42acdd1.en.html", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117539665557544960/ST94Uo6y?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117539665557544960/ST94Uo6y?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 250, "status": 200, "title": "Simplification and complexity in the banking union: separating the wheat from the chaff", "unwound_url": "https://www.bankingsupervision.europa.eu/press/speeches/date/2026/html/ssm.sp261103~dff42acdd1.en.html", "url": "https://t.co/DfQ3FTSYfi"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/4lKWToSKjD", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ecb/status/2117539650411827379/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117539640630448128", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/4lKWToSKjD"}]}, "id": "2117539650411827379", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 7196, "like_count": 29, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Simplification should make banking rules more proportionate and easier to understand, not lower capital standards, says Supervisory Board member Pedro Machado. He adds that the biggest hurdle for competitiveness is Europe’s fragmented banking market https://t.co/DfQ3FTSYfi https://t.co/4lKWToSKjD", "url": "https://x.com/ecb/status/2117539650411827379"}, {"author_id": "83466368", "created_at": "2026-11-03T07:46:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117523684814442941"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/QykxM2CQlb", "end": 281, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ecb/status/2117523684814442941/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117523637380984832", "start": 258, "url": "https://t.co/QykxM2CQlb"}]}, "id": "2117523684814442941", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 7351, "like_count": 25, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "Watch live at 9:45 CET: Supervisory Board member Pedro Machado talks about the simplification of banking regulation and supervision at the 12th Conference on the Banking Union, organised by the Goethe University Institute for Law and Finance.\n\nRegister here https://t.co/QykxM2CQlb", "url": "https://x.com/ecb/status/2117523684814442941"}, {"author_id": "39125788", "created_at": "2026-11-03T06:26:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117503772398178763"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ZmlVl4pcse", "end": 144, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/emollick/status/2117503772398178763/video/1", "media_key": "13_2117503635084992512", "start": 121, "url": "https://t.co/ZmlVl4pcse"}, {"display_url": "x.com/emollick/statu…", "end": 168, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/emollick/status/2117372481191239762", "start": 145, "url": "https://t.co/JYHV2tWK7v"}]}, "id": "2117503772398178763", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 189, "impression_count": 38678, "like_count": 381, "quote_count": 14, "reply_count": 165, "retweet_count": 20}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117372481191239762", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "\"Opus, great, now turn that into a movie, i know you can make it amazing. figure it out.\"\n\nYes, that was the only prompt https://t.co/ZmlVl4pcse https://t.co/JYHV2tWK7v", "url": "https://x.com/emollick/status/2117503772398178763"}, {"author_id": "1214528593", "created_at": "2026-11-03T05:14:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117485623267459304"], "id": "2117485623267459304", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2975, "like_count": 16, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Claude (the Code mode in Mac OS) has gotten really pushy lately with all these suggested follow up projects that I don’t need\n\nDoesn’t actually waste tokens bc I ~never say yes, but it’s weird", "url": "https://x.com/Miles_Brundage/status/2117485623267459304"}, {"author_id": "1214528593", "created_at": "2026-11-03T05:01:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117482217891152044"], "id": "2117482217891152044", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 26491, "like_count": 244, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 17, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "Boomers / dads are simply correct that WWII is very interesting", "url": "https://x.com/Miles_Brundage/status/2117482217891152044"}, {"author_id": "279036722", "created_at": "2026-11-03T04:04:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117467969923985714"], "id": "2117467969923985714", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 15, "impression_count": 31732, "like_count": 109, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "My vote plans on 3 MA ballot initiatives on economic issues, in case helpful in thinking for anyone voting here. And I should say, my rebuttable presumption is always no--nine initiatives on the ballot is a terrible way to govern. Legislature not perfect but better than this.", "url": "https://x.com/jasonfurman/status/2117467969923985714"}, {"author_id": "39125788", "created_at": "2026-11-03T02:33:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117445039211086096"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/sPZZDFYAf4", "end": 309, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/emollick/status/2117445039211086096/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117444582514229248", "start": 286, "url": "https://t.co/sPZZDFYAf4"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/sPZZDFYAf4", "end": 309, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/emollick/status/2117445039211086096/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117444958340689920", "start": 286, "url": "https://t.co/sPZZDFYAf4"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/sPZZDFYAf4", "end": 309, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/emollick/status/2117445039211086096/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117444980578930688", "start": 286, "url": "https://t.co/sPZZDFYAf4"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/sPZZDFYAf4", "end": 309, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/emollick/status/2117445039211086096/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117445019833360385", "start": 286, "url": "https://t.co/sPZZDFYAf4"}]}, "id": "2117445039211086096", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 799, "impression_count": 104198, "like_count": 1686, "quote_count": 41, "reply_count": 230, "retweet_count": 154}, "text": "This is a fantastic idea - a mass attempted replication of old findings of LLMs with new models. Much conventional wisdom is outdated.\n\nRecent models no longer invent citations and both hallucination rates &amp; stereotyping has dropped. But they are still sycophantic &amp; lean left. https://t.co/sPZZDFYAf4", "url": "https://x.com/emollick/status/2117445039211086096"}, {"author_id": "612896910", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117406404613140940"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 154, "start": 146, "tag": "BLSdata"}], "urls": [{"description": "The .gov means it's official. Federal government websites often end in .gov or .mil. Before sharing sensitive information, make sure you're on a federal government site. The site is secure. The https:// ensures that you are connecting to the official website and that any information you provide is encrypted and transmitted securely. From January 2023 through December 2025, there were 3.3 million workers displaced from jobs they had held for at least 3 years. In January 2026, 66.1 percent of these long-tenu", "display_url": "bls.gov/opub/ted/2026/…", "end": 145, "expanded_url": "https://www.bls.gov/opub/ted/2026/three-fourths-of-long-tenured-workers-displaced-from-jobs-in-health-care-and-social-assistance-reemployed-in-january-2026.htm", "images": [{"height": 126, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117292980025626624/9SOCR8Ao?format=png&name=orig", "width": 228}, {"height": 126, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117292980025626624/9SOCR8Ao?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 126}], "start": 122, "status": 200, "title": "Three-fourths of long-tenu